# One yt-dlp argument per line. Lines starting with # are comments; blank lines ignored.
# These arguments are inserted before the URL on every invocation.
-P
H:\Users\User\Downloads
--no-playlist
--no-progress
--windows-filenames
# Pull login cookies from Firefox Nightly: needed for sensitive-marked/login-gated
# tweets (anonymous GraphQL returns no media for them). Verified working 2026-09-22.
--cookies-from-browser
firefox:C:\Users\User\AppData\Roaming\Mozilla\Firefox\Profiles\855g30f3.default-nightly
